Attacks pass through armor (+4 THAC0).~
@10090 = ~Blindsight~
@10091 = ~Invisibility, darkness, and most kinds of concealment are irrelevant.
Blindsight does not subject a creature to gaze attacks.~
@10092 = ~Ooze~
